          "solution": {
            "answer": "$z_1 z_2 = 5 + i$ និង $\\dfrac{z_1}{z_2} = -\\dfrac{1}{2} + \\dfrac{5}{2}i$",
            "steps": [
              "$z_1 z_2 = (2 + 3i)(1 - i) = 2 - 2i + 3i - 3i^2 = 2 + i + 3 = 5 + i$",
              "គុណភាគយក និងភាគបែងនឹងកុំផ្លិចឆ្លាស់ $1 + i$៖ $\\dfrac{z_1}{z_2} = \\dfrac{(2 + 3i)(1 + i)}{(1 - i)(1 + i)}$",
              "$= \\dfrac{2 + 2i + 3i + 3i^2}{2} = \\dfrac{-1 + 5i}{2} = -\\dfrac{1}{2} + \\dfrac{5}{2}i$"
            ]
          }
        }
